{"content_hash": "2725d7298a67981c", "version_id": 181, "article_id": 19, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Arteta becomes the highest-paid manager in the Premier League", "title_zh": "阿尔特塔成为英超工资最高的主教练", "topic": "sports", "source": "skysports", "source_url": "https://www.skysports.com/football/news/12040/13596325/arsenal-manager-mikel-arteta-becomes-premier-leagues-highest-paid-boss-on-20m-a-year-new-contract-paper-talk", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://e2.365dm.com/26/08/1920x1080/skysports-paper-talk-football_7317647.jpg?20260809160824", "credit": ""}, "published_date": "2026-10-07", "word_count": 215, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "Mikel Arteta has a new contract at Arsenal. He now earns £20m a year. He is the highest-paid manager in the Premier League.", "lead_zh": "米克尔·阿尔特塔在阿森纳签了新合同。他现在一年能挣2000万英镑。他是英超工资最高的主教练。", "preview": "Mikel Arteta is the manager of Arsenal. He has a new contract. He now earns £20 million every year. This makes him the highest-paid manager ", "preview_zh": "米克尔·阿尔特塔是阿森纳的主教练。他签了新合同。他现在每年挣2000万英镑。这让他成为英超工资最高的主教练。这个消息来自《每日邮报》。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 173, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e099b16/content/audio/19/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 92.137, "size_bytes": 556704, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 247, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e099b16/content/data/versions/181.json", "paragraphs": ["Mikel Arteta is the manager of Arsenal. He has a new contract. He now earns £20 million every year. This makes him the highest-paid manager in the Premier League. The news comes from the Daily Mail.", "Liverpool want to sign another big player. They already have a strong attack. They want to add more power to their team. This news comes from the Daily Star.", "Thomas Tuchel is the England manager. He says the team is doing well without Cole Palmer. England played well in the Nations League. Palmer was not there.", "Kieran McKenna has a new job. He now works for UEFA. He is a technical observer. This is only months after he left Ipswich.", "Cheikhou Kouyate is a former Premier League player. He has a heart problem for many years. He kept it a secret. He recently stopped playing football.", "Lionel Messi played his last game for Argentina. The referee gave him a yellow card and a red card. This was a strange gift.", "Mary Fowler is an Australian football star. She left her national team suddenly. She went back to Australia. Her boyfriend Nathan Cleary is injured.", "Rwanda may host a Formula 1 race. It could be the first race in Africa in many years. South Africa also wants to host it."], "paragraphs_zh": ["米克尔·阿尔特塔是阿森纳的主教练。他签了新合同。他现在每年挣2000万英镑。这让他成为英超工资最高的主教练。这个消息来自《每日邮报》。", "利物浦想再签一名大牌球员。他们已经有很强的锋线。他们想给球队增加更多力量。这个消息来自《每日星报》。", "托马斯·图赫尔是英格兰队主教练。他说没有科尔·帕尔默，球队也踢得很好。英格兰队在欧国联比赛中表现不错。帕尔默没有参加。", "基兰·麦肯纳有了新工作。他现在为欧足联工作。他是一名技术观察员。这距离他离开伊普斯维奇才几个月。", "谢库·库亚特是一名前英超球员。他有多年的心脏问题。他一直保密。他最近退役了。", "莱昂内尔·梅西踢了他在阿根廷队的最后一场比赛。裁判给了他一张黄牌和一张红牌。这是一个奇怪的礼物。", "玛丽·福勒是澳大利亚足球明星。她突然离开了国家队。她回到了澳大利亚。她的男朋友内森·克利里受伤了。", "卢旺达可能举办F1比赛。这可能是非洲多年来的第一场比赛。南非也想举办。"], "body": "Mikel Arteta is the manager of Arsenal. He has a new contract. He now earns £20 million every year. This makes him the highest-paid manager in the Premier League. The news comes from the Daily Mail.\n\nLiverpool want to sign another big player. They already have a strong attack. They want to add more power to their team. This news comes from the Daily Star.\n\nThomas Tuchel is the England manager. He says the team is doing well without Cole Palmer. England played well in the Nations League. Palmer was not there.\n\nKieran McKenna has a new job. He now works for UEFA. He is a technical observer. This is only months after he left Ipswich.\n\nCheikhou Kouyate is a former Premier League player. He has a heart problem for many years. He kept it a secret. He recently stopped playing football.\n\nLionel Messi played his last game for Argentina. The referee gave him a yellow card and a red card. This was a strange gift.\n\nMary Fowler is an Australian football star. She left her national team suddenly. She went back to Australia. Her boyfriend Nathan Cleary is injured.\n\nRwanda may host a Formula 1 race. It could be the first race in Africa in many years. South Africa also wants to host it.", "body_zh": "米克尔·阿尔特塔是阿森纳的主教练。他签了新合同。他现在每年挣2000万英镑。这让他成为英超工资最高的主教练。这个消息来自《每日邮报》。\n\n利物浦想再签一名大牌球员。他们已经有很强的锋线。他们想给球队增加更多力量。这个消息来自《每日星报》。\n\n托马斯·图赫尔是英格兰队主教练。他说没有科尔·帕尔默，球队也踢得很好。英格兰队在欧国联比赛中表现不错。帕尔默没有参加。\n\n基兰·麦肯纳有了新工作。他现在为欧足联工作。他是一名技术观察员。这距离他离开伊普斯维奇才几个月。\n\n谢库·库亚特是一名前英超球员。他有多年的心脏问题。他一直保密。他最近退役了。\n\n莱昂内尔·梅西踢了他在阿根廷队的最后一场比赛。裁判给了他一张黄牌和一张红牌。这是一个奇怪的礼物。\n\n玛丽·福勒是澳大利亚足球明星。她突然离开了国家队。她回到了澳大利亚。她的男朋友内森·克利里受伤了。\n\n卢旺达可能举办F1比赛。这可能是非洲多年来的第一场比赛。南非也想举办。", "text": "Mikel Arteta is the manager of Arsenal. He has a new contract. He now earns £20 million every year. This makes him the highest-paid manager in the Premier League. The news comes from the Daily Mail. Liverpool want to sign another big player. They already have a strong attack. They want to add more power to their team. This news comes from the Daily Star. Thomas Tuchel is the England manager. He says the team is doing well without Cole Palmer. England played well in the Nations League. Palmer was not there. Kieran McKenna has a new job. He now works for UEFA. He is a technical observer. This is only months after he left Ipswich. Cheikhou Kouyate is a former Premier League player. He has a heart problem for many years. He kept it a secret. He recently stopped playing football. Lionel Messi played his last game for Argentina. The referee gave him a yellow card and a red card. This was a strange gift. Mary Fowler is an Australian football star. She left her national team suddenly. She went back to Australia. Her boyfriend Nathan Cleary is injured. Rwanda may host a Formula 1 race. It could be the first race in Africa in many years. South Africa also wants to host it.", "vocab": [{"word": "manager", "pos": "noun", "zh": "主教练", "note": "体育中常指球队的主教练"}, {"word": "contract", "pos": "noun", "zh": "合同", "note": "常与 sign 搭配，表示签合同"}, {"word": "earn", "pos": "verb", "zh": "挣（钱）", "note": "后面接钱数"}, {"word": "highest-paid", "pos": "adj", "zh": "工资最高的", "note": "由 highest 和 paid 组成"}, {"word": "sign", "pos": "verb", "zh": "签（球员）", "note": "体育中表示与球员签约"}, {"word": "player", "pos": "noun", "zh": "球员", "note": "常用词"}, {"word": "referee", "pos": "noun", "zh": "裁判", "note": "足球比赛中执法的人"}, {"word": "race", "pos": "noun", "zh": "比赛", "note": "常指赛车比赛"}], "title_original": "Papers: Arteta becomes Premier League's highest-paid boss on £20m-a-year", "summary_original": "The top stories and transfer rumours from Wednesday's newspapers...", "body_original": "Arsenal manager Mikel Arteta becomes Premier League's highest-paid boss on £20m-a-year new contract - Paper Talk\nPlus: Liverpool weigh up another blockbuster signing to add to their mega money attacking line-up; Thomas Tuchel says the \"train is rolling\" without Cole Palmer after England impressed in his absence during the Nations League camp; Kieran McKenna lands UEFA job months after leaving Ipswich\nWednesday 7 October 2026 23:07, UK\nThe top stories and transfer rumours from Wednesday's newspapers...\nPREMIER LEAGUE\nMikel Arteta has become the Premier League's highest-paid boss on a £20m-a-year new contract -\nDaily Mail\nLiverpool are weighing up another blockbuster signing to add to their mega money attacking line-up -\nDaily Star\nTransfer Centre LIVE!\n|\nLatest on YOUR PL club!\nGot Sky?\nWatch LIVE football on your phone\n📱\nNot got Sky?\nGet Sky Sports\nor\nstream with no contract on NOW\nThe agent of Gianluigi Donnarumma, Enzo Raiola, has revealed Manchester City have provided his client with reassurances after the club's recent guilty verdict -\nDaily Mirror\nKieran McKenna has landed a new job working as a technical observer for UEFA just months after leaving Ipsw